  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "filter-d1-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Keep only transfers who transferred to a DI school\n",
    "\n",
    "The API only lists a `conference` for Division I teams, so a missing conference means the team is not D1. We keep a transfer only if his **new** school is D1. His **prior** school can be anything in the data (D1, D2, D3, NAIA), since a coach can still evaluate a player coming from a lower division. Players coming from overseas never appear in last year's data, so they are not in this table. We keep a flag for whether the prior school was D1, because stats from lower divisions are not on the same scale."
   ]
