, 'Truman State', 'Tufts', 'Tusculum', 'Tuskegee', 'UC Merced', 'UC Santa Cruz', 'UNT Dallas', 'UT Dallas', 'UT Permian Basin', 'UT Tyler', 'UVA Wise', 'UW-Parkside', 'Union (KY)', 'Union (NY)', 'Union (TN)', 'University Of Saint Mary', 'University Of The Virgin Islands', 'University of Health Sciences & Pharmacy', 'University of New England', 'University of Saint Katherine', 'University of The Southwest', 'University of Wisconsin River Falls', 'Urbana', 'Valley City', 'Valley Forge', 'Vanguard', 'Vassar', 'Vermont State - Johnson', 'Vermont State - Lyndon', 'Vermont State - Randolph', 'Virginia St', 'Virginia Wesleyan', 'Virginia-Lynchburg', 'Voorhees', 'WPI', 'WVU Tech', 'Wabash College', 'Waldorf College', 'Walla Walla', 'Warner Pacific', 'Warner University', 'Warren Wilson', 'Wartburg', 'Washburn', 'Washington Adventist', 'Washington College (MD)', 'Washington and Lee', 'Wayland Baptist', 'Wayne State (MI)', 'Waynesburg', 'Webber International', 'Webster', 'Wells College', 'Wesley', 'West Coast Baptist', 'West Florida', 'West Virginia Wesleyan', 'Westcliff', 'Western Colorado', 'Western New England', 'Western New Mexico', 'Western Oregon', 'Westfield State', 'Westminster (MO)', 'Westminster (PA)', 'Westminster (UT)', 'Westmont', 'Wheeling', 'Whitman', 'Whittier', 'Whitworth', 'Widener', 'Wilberforce', 'Wiley', 'Wilkes University', 'Willamette', 'William Carey', 'William Jewell', 'William Peace', 'William Woods', 'Williams Baptist', 'Wilmington (DE)', 'Wilson College', 'Wingate', 'Wisconsin-Lutheran', 'Wisconsin-Stout', 'Wisconsin-Superior', 'Wittenberg', 'Worcester State', 'Xavier (LA)', 'Yellowstone Christian College', 'York (NY)', 'York College Nebraska']\n"
