      "source": [
        "The correlation matrix shows that many of our 37 prior-season features have strong correlations and overlap with each other. Some of the strongest relationships include points per game and field goal attempts per game (0.97), total and defensive rebounds per game (0.97), effective field goal percentage and true shooting percentage (0.95), field goal percentage and effective field goal percentage (0.93), and minutes per game and field goal attempts per game (0.90). Most other pairs are only weakly or moderately correlated. Because some features overlap with each other, we will probably be able to use a smaller set of features for our predictions versus all 37."
      ]
