      "source": [
        "# Compare starter rates by prior school D1 status and position group\n",
        "print(\"Starter rate by prior school D1 status (1 = D1, 0 = Non-D1):\")\n",
        "display(\n",
        "    transfers_d1.groupby(\"prior_school_d1\")[\"starter\"]\n",
        "    .agg(count=\"count\", starter_rate=\"mean\")\n",
        "    .round(3)\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nStarter rate by grouped position:\")\n",
        "display(\n",
        "    transfers_d1.groupby(\"position_group\")[\"starter\"]\n",
        "    .agg(count=\"count\", starter_rate=\"mean\")\n",
        "    .sort_values(\"starter_rate\", ascending=False)\n",
        "    .round(3)\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "# For ESPN-ranked transfers, bucket rank into tiers to inspect starter rate\n",
        "ranked_df = transfers_d1[transfers_d1[\"espn_preseason_rank\"].notna()].copy()\n",
        "ranked_df[\"rank_tier\"] = pd.cut(\n",
        "    ranked_df[\"espn_preseason_rank\"],\n",
        "    bins=[0, 25, 50, 100, 500],\n",
        "    labels=[\"Top 25\", \"26–50\", \"51–100\", \"101+\"],\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "rank_summary = (\n",
        "    ranked_df.groupby(\"rank_tier\", observed=False)[\"starter\"]\n",
        "    .agg(count=\"count\", starter_rate=\"mean\")\n",
        "    .reset_index()\n",
        ")\n",
        "rank_summary[\"starter_rate_pct\"] = (rank_summary[\"starter_rate\"] * 100).round(1)\n",
        "display(rank_summary)\n",
        "\n",
        "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(7, 4))\n",
        "ax.bar(rank_summary[\"rank_tier\"].astype(str), rank_summary[\"starter_rate_pct\"])\n",
        "ax.set_xlabel(\"ESPN Preseason Transfer Rank Tier\")\n",
        "ax.set_ylabel(\"Starters (%)\")\n",
        "ax.set_ylim(0, 100)\n",
        "ax.set_title(\"Starter Rate Among Matched ESPN-Ranked Transfers\")\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "zBUetecQEZXx",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "zBUetecQEZXx"
      },
      "source": [
        "This block evaluates how starter rates vary across three contextual groupings: prior-school division status (prior_school_d1), grouped playing positions (position_group), and tiered buckets of espn_preseason_rank (Top 25, 26-50, 51-100, 101+) among players with ESPN preseason rankings. Transfers coming from Division I programs (prior_school_d1 = 1, n = 5,368) start at a substantially higher rate (54.7%) than those arriving from non-D1 programs (prior_school_d1 = 0, n = 141, 34.8%), while guards (G, n = 3,128) start at a higher rate (58.1%) than forwards (F, n = 2,014, 49.3%), centers (C, n = 329, 48.3%), and Other (n = 38, 42.1%). As shown in the table and bar chart of matched ESPN-ranked transfers (with Starters (%) from 0 to 100 on the vertical axis), starter rates step down monotonically as preseason rank gets less prestigious, moving from 89.3% in Top 25 (n = 121) to 76.7% in 26-50 (n = 120) and 72.4% in 51-100 (n = 232), with 0 players (NaN) in the 101+ tier because the 2022-2026 ESPN transfer rankings included 100 players per class, confirming that higher-ranked incoming transfers start noticeably more often and justifying the inclusion of these context features."
      ]
    },
